configure Agent Controls:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Define Controls in the Console</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/ai/4-splunk-agent-observability/8-apply-guardrails/2-define-controls/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/ai/4-splunk-agent-observability/8-apply-guardrails/2-define-controls/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;The app now &lt;em&gt;registers&lt;/em&gt; its controllable steps, but it&amp;rsquo;s the Splunk Agent Observability console where you
