&lt;span class="exercise__bar-label"&gt;Exercise&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-divider" aria-hidden="true"&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class="exercise__bar-title"&gt;Define controls in Splunk Agent Observability&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__panel"&gt;
&lt;div class="exercise__body"&gt;
&lt;section class="step"&gt;
&lt;div class="step__num"&gt;1&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;header class="step__head"&gt;&lt;p class="step__title"&gt;Open the Controls tab&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;div class="step__body"&gt;&lt;p&gt;In your browser, go to the Splunk Agent Observability console at &lt;code&gt;https://console.multitenant.sao.splunkcloud.com&lt;/code&gt;
and &lt;strong&gt;&lt;code&gt;workshop&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; org&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Open the &lt;code&gt;Splunk Agent Observability Workshop&lt;/code&gt; project, and select the agent stream that
matches the Instance ID you found above (such as &lt;code&gt;shw-51ea&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Test the Controls</title><link>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/ai/4-splunk-agent-observability/8-apply-guardrails/3-test-controls/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://splunk.github.io/observability-workshop/en/ninja-workshops/ai/4-splunk-agent-observability/8-apply-guardrails/3-test-controls/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;With the controls defined, run the app and trigger them. You&amp;rsquo;ll see the block and steer
